      "notes": "Main substrate silhouette remains photograph-estimated, not board CAD. The exact rear source now documents soldermask/pad/silkscreen appearance. UNKNOWN moves to the undocumented front layer below the radio module and is exposed by the existing radio inspection separation. Layer stack, internal copper, hidden parts and component heights remain unknown. Existing outline/hole registration has approximately +/-0.4mm photo uncertainty. The prior small upper through-hole estimate is removed: the exact rear source shows continuous soldermask there. The front bright spot remains photograph appearance only, not an invented through-hole."
    },
